{"type":"text","timestamp":1794545811662,"sessionID":"ses_e2cbdff25ffe140x8uwawtp8aL","part":{"id":"prt_1d343f47a001gMqYyr3RwIpBtD","sessionID":"ses_e2cbdff25ffe140x8uwawtp8aL","messageID":"msg_1d343e0eb001cUARDW0yeXyMaF","type":"text","text":"T012 complete.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml` (only file touched; +5/−2)\n\nChanges exactly as the task line specifies:\n- `purpose` and `action`: `six` → `seven`\n- `upstream_assets`: added `hook_wiring_check` and `codex_approval_check`\n- `execution.steps`: added the `Leg delivery` step immediately after `Leg embedder`, using the task's exact wording\n\n**Verify output** (task's own command)\n\n```\n$ rg -c \"seven\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml\n2\n$ rg -c \"six\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml\n(no output — zero matches, rg exit 1, confirmed with `rg -n \"six\"` → exit=1, no lines)\n$ rg -c \"Leg delivery\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml\n1\n$ node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-setup-orphan-line.test.cjs\n✔ doctor setup prints the orphan summary as informational output (0.62625ms)\nℹ tests 1\nℹ pass 1\nℹ fail 0\n```\n\n`rg -c` prints no line for a zero count, so the `six` check reports 0 matches as required. All four expected values hold.\n\nAdditional sanity check: the file still parses as YAML (`python3 -c \"import yaml; yaml.safe_load(...)\"` → `yaml-ok`, 12 execution steps), and `git diff --stat` scopes to the one named file.\n\n**Not done / notes**\n- The `tasks.md` checkbox was left unticked, per instructions.\n- No blockers; nothing else was needed.","time":{"start":1794545808506,"end":1794545811662}}}
